// name :
"P2949012791" "My Best Friend, Rusty"
// // requiresfailedtext :
"P0" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NewLeader 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2782493033" "Syndicate Branching"
// DetailString :
"P934855532" "You found some documents dealing with the Syndicate and their group splitting. Ever since Mr. Yin defected to the Resistance, the Syndicate have been in a major power struggle. There's been rumors of a concrete faction growing more and more powerful, led by a man whose name is known only to those closest to him. Other, more disturbing, rumors are that this man intends to use Metronome to throw the Resistance and Cole into chaos, allowing he and his group to gain a foothold of power within Praetoria."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Documents 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P834816721" "Syndicate and Metronome"
// DetailString :
"P176681683" "You found a dossier on Master West outlining the Syndicate's plan with Metronome. It has very detailed information on how Metronome operates; whoever found this must have been observing Metronome for quite some time.<br><br>Metronome has been gathering Seers and killing them, in a sense. He uses his powers to transfer their souls into that of the Clockwork, allowing them to live 'freely' inside of their bodies. The more Seers that are around Metronome, either in their Clockwork bodies or normal bodies, the more powerful he becomes. There is a disturbing note at the end of the dossier.<br><br>'Get him enough Seers and he'll have more than enough power to spread unbridled chaos through the city and the tunnels. Cole, the Resistance, Metronome, they'll all be wiped out, and then we move in. Yin was too soft, he lacked the courage to make a move. Things will change now. I promise.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WalkterTalk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2881543154" "Gregory Vega"
// DetailString :
"P1141445018" "After handling matters with the Clockwork, Aaron Walker contacted you.<br><br>'Good job, {HeroName}. I got you some hard data right here. Looks like the guy who is leading this whole Syndicate matter is named Gregory Vega. Not too much data on him, says he became part of the Syndicate about four years ago. Pretty underwhelming guy, to be honest. I dunno how he got himself a high position like this, but there you go. I've got a location for you on where you can find him.<br><br>Oh, yeah. I checked out if anyone else is on the look out for him. Found some top secret Resistance info, guy by the name of <i>Dark Watcher</i> is gonna be there too.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Malta 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2954916538" "The Malta Guard"
// DetailString :
"P3562240759" "You were able to intercept the transmission that Gregory Vega was making. You play it back from the beginning to hear what he was going to say...<br><br>'With the help of this Metronome, I have discovered that our worst case scenario is coming true. Marcus Cole has created a massive army, the likes of which we have never seen before. He intends to launch everything he has at Primal Earth. I've seen the schematics of some of his machines. They make ours look like Council toys. I'm making a full recommendation to-'<br><br>The message cuts off there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - PraetoriaYinStoryArc 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P401906466" "Memory of Penelope Yin"
// tDetailString :
"P3195215446" "When you look at the Clockwork in Praetoria, you sometimes can't help but think of them as 'teddy bears'. Penelope Yin referred to them in this manner during an experience you call...<br><br><color Paragon>My Best Friend, Rusty</color><br><br>Your time with Penelope Yin started with her calling you Rusty and asking you to stop the monster Glowball and the Dark Knights helping him to destroy the Mirror Kingdom. If you thought some of the members of the Resistance were bad with their way of speaking, Penelope Yin did them one better. After working with Penelope, you eventually found out what was happening; Metronome was working together with the Syndicate to increase his own power in the hopes of freeing Penelope Yin and making a 'perfect world'.<br><br>The Syndicate were helping Metronome kidnap Seers to rip their souls out of their bodies and into the Clockwork, causing Metronome's own power to increase exponentially. You tried to stop this process, but were only able to bring the Seer Clockwork to the Resistance, where they would be well taken care of. You were able, however, to defeat the leader of this Syndicate cell with the help of Aaron Walker. The man's name was Gregory Vega. The Dark Watcher revealed to you that this man was part of a group named Malta. They were from Primal Earth and believed that super powered beings would lead to a tyrannical government.<br><br>With the Syndicate out of the way, you faced off against Metronome's remaining Clockwork with the Noble Savage. The two of you stopped Metronome's ascension to power while learning a terrible secret; Cole had a massive army built and was preparing to invade Primal Earth! You saw some of the models of his 'War Walkers' in the lab with Metronome; if Cole had more of those, it would be the end of Primal Earth and the Resistance for sure.<br><br>You returned to Penelope, who told you that she had Metronome in a safe place, for now. It was now time for you to go on your new 'tale' as she said. Perhaps one day, the two of you will get to meet face to face, if she ever brings down Praetor Tilman and escapes from her prison."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4020788473" "<color Plum><font outline=2>Rusty, the Mirror Kingdom is going to be in chaos if all the teddy bears are stolen away! The evil Glowball wants to use them for his own evil deeds. Glowball used to be like you, Rusty, he used to be my bestest friend! But now... Glowball thinks he knows what's best. He's become like the Shadowlord!<br><br>I miss how Glowball used to be, it hurts me a lot to see him like this. That's why I need your help, Rusty! Glowball is working together with those Black Knights now, they want to make him really powerful. These aren't the Black Knights that the Good King leads though. That's why we need to find out why the Black Knights have allied themselves with Glowball!</color></font>"
// AcceptString :
"P1744315294" "Who... what? Glowball?"
// SendOffString :
"P1216750333" "<color orange>You see several images flash before you. One of Metronome, another of possessed Clockwork. The last is an image of members of the Syndicate. It would appear Penelope is trying to encode a message to you. The Syndicate are helping Metronome possess more Clockwork. While it does hurt Cole, Metronome also seeks to steal away Clockwork that the Resistance have. The Syndicate helping Metronome can only lead to something bad for both Cole and the Resistance.</color><br><br><color plum><font outline=2>The Black Knight West is one of the knights that are helping Glowball, Rusty! You need to hurry and find him, Glowball's evil influence is spreading by the minute. If you don't stop him, he'll wipe out everyone in Mirror Kingdom! "
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2326659347" "Defeat West, the Black Knight"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2266376469" "<color orange>You're unable to hear Penelope.</color>"
// TaskTitle :
"P803974649" "<color deepskyblue>My Best Friend, Rusty</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P496352232" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: The Legion of Black Knights</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3905293543" "You follow the images in your mind that Penelope left to this office building. You'll have to track down a man named West to find out what the Syndicate are doing with Metronome."

