"P3560841915" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>Pssst, Rusty. Mother is dealing with a new Playtime Friend, so I get to come back to play with you!"
// SaysList :
"P1053568496" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>Glowball used to be so lonely, wandering around by himself. But then I found him and brought him back to people! He was so happy, Rusty!"
// SaysList :
"P1184256313" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>We used to talk all the time... I think I was his only friend. He was so lonely, Rusty. So lonely and so sad..."
// SaysList :
"P3741494100" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>But then... R-rusty? Is that... one of my Playtime Friends...? No... Glowball...! "

