"P320205919" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>It's the Magician! I KNEW he rode here on his horse!"
// SaysList :
"P1585992067" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Purple>The Magician's words about what I'm doing is true, Rusty! I love Mother very much and want to see her get what she deserves!"

