// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2285579365" "How did we not know about this? About Cole's plans?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3591539082" "{HeroName}, stay out of this! This is between us, Cole, and Metronome!"

