// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Vega 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P4076582897" "Defeat Gregory Vega"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3338475154" "You defeated Gregory Vega, the head of the Syndicate cell!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P956230773" "<color Plum><font outline=2>Take that, you evil Black Knight! Rusty the powerful will never let you win! With Black Knight Vega done for, the Good King can try to get more of his Knights back under his banner. This is great! But we still have Glowball to deal with. I miss what I used to call Glowball, back when he was... someone different, a Star like you, Rusty!<br><br>We have no time though, Glowball found where Shadowlord is making some of his most powerful weapons. He's become so powerful that he's going to use all the teddy bears he has to become one BIG teddy bear that the Shadowlord made! If Glowball does that... I don't even want to think about what's going to happen!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2126338397" "<color Plum><font outline=2>The final battle is here, Rusty! Are you ready to stop Glowball before he becomes consumed by the evil power? Please, don't hate Glowball, Rusty. He was a good person once, until... until he lost his faith in humanity! He doesn't think us humans are strong enough to fight, he thinks that we can only be at our best if we're all teddy bears, but I say he's wrong! I say that maybe we can be weak, but together we can take the fight to the Shadowlord and free the Mirror Kingdom! And to do that, we need to save Glowball from himself!<br><br>But don't worry, Rusty, you won't have to do it alone!"
// AcceptString :
"P2387470853" "Who is going to help me?"
// SendOffString :
"P1889400986" "<color Plum><font outline=2>The Blue Fish are sending the Faithful Lion to help you, he doesn't want Glowball or the Shadowlord to get away with any of this!<br><br>I can see what Glowball sees, Rusty. He's gathered all the Teddy Bears that are powering him up to focus their energy, while he has my Playtime Friends underground increasing his power! The Magician said he's going to rescue my Playtime Friends, but you need to stop the Teddy Bears from making Glowball into a big monster Teddy Bear! There's eighty teddy bears in total, you'll only have three minutes before they all become monsters!<br><br> If you can destroy them all with the Faithful Lion, I can seal Glowball in one of them! Maybe with his power gone, Glowball will go back to being a good person!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2434523164" "Stop Metronome's Ascension to Power"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3014933312" "<color orange>Penelope Yin is unresponsive.</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3346285908" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: On the Brink of Power</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1224936092" "You're greeted by James Noble, or as Penelope Yin calls him, the 'Faithful Lion'."

