// SaysList :
"P1798121137" "<t=4 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> You are too late to stop me, {HeroName}.<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> I shall soon assume my final body, the body of Cole's War Walker!<t=4 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> No one will stop me from freeing Penelope!<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> Then... I will end all this war in Praetoria! Cole, the Resistance, the Syndicate...<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> I... will make this world what it was supposed to be. A utopia!"
// SaysList :
"P701657574" "<t=4 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> No... what have you done... what have you done?!<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> I was going to save everyone... Penelope... stop... don't do this... no... no...!"

