// Dialog :
"P2246094255" "You've stopped Metronome's rise to power."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2975950326" "<color Plum><font outline=2>You're the hero of all the stories, Rusty! I've got Glowball contained in one of the Teddy Bears, but I don't know how long I can hold him, given the... well, the Magician told you the fairy tale that I'm in, so you know. I wish... I wish that Glowball would become good again. I would like that a lot. Maybe then, you and him could find the Good King and mommy and we can all stop the Shadowlord and... the others.<br><br>But that's just me thinking of the next fairytale, Rusty. Right now, I have to go off on my own tale, and you need to go off on yours! But there's one last thing I need you to do. The Magician wants to meet with you for an audience in his castle!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
